  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 429.78 K, melting point of In; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.780$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 9 0 5 + 0. 0 2 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 4 7 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ \\mathrm{H} ^ {0} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {0} = 8. 9 0 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 0 1 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 4 7 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 8 1 4 \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 4 2 9. 7 8 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = 3 9. 8 3 0 + 2. 1 1 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 4. 9 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 9 5. 7 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 3 9. 8 3 0 - 2. 1 1 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 4. 9 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 4 7. 8 7 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 7. 3 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ 4 2 9. 7 8 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = 4 0. 1 9 0 - 2. 2 3 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 1 4 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 3 0. 0 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 4 0. 1 9 0 + 2. 2 3 4 x 1 0 ^ {- 3} T \\ln T + 0. 1 4 0 x 1 0 ^ {- 6} T ^ {2} + 1 5. 0 2 5 T ^ {- 1} - 3 2. 2 7 7 x 1 0 ^ {- 3} T \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nSource: Data from Mills (80) who estimated all except enthalpy of formation at 298 K. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase change: 429.78 K, melting point of In; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.780$ kcal/mol.",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "$$",
      "\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 9 0 5 + 0. 0 2 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 4 7 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ \\mathrm{H} ^ {0} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {0} = 8. 9 0 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 0 1 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 4 7 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 8 1 4 \\\\ \\end{array}",
      "$$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "$$",
      "\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 4 2 9. 7 8 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = 3 9. 8 3 0 + 2. 1 1 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 4. 9 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 9 5. 7 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 3 9. 8 3 0 - 2. 1 1 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 4. 9 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 4 7. 8 7 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 7. 3 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ 4 2 9. 7 8 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = 4 0. 1 9 0 - 2. 2 3 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 1 4 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 3 0. 0 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 4 0. 1 9 0 + 2. 2 3 4 x 1 0 ^ {- 3} T \\ln T + 0. 1 4 0 x 1 0 ^ {- 6} T ^ {2} + 1 5. 0 2 5 T ^ {- 1} - 3 2. 2 7 7 x 1 0 ^ {- 3} T \\\\ \\end{array}",
      "$$",
